  "final_message": "AlmaLinux OSV records now add advisory `fixes` entries to every range with a `fixed` event, using the UTC date of the upstream `published` field. This includes library package clones and preserves the record-level `record_type` marker. The parser accepts an optional fix date finder, supports context management, and downloads its data once per run. I also wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-egffqzu8/vunnel/answer.json).\n\nThe focused AlmaLinux tests and 1,338 unit tests passed. The full suite had unrelated failures: missing `yardstick` for quality tests and a filesystem permission error in a Go release-date test.",
